  "note": "The indexed words for a goat, a frog, a fingernail and a diadem have distinct meanings with uncertain historical relationships to bird. Tyre, its people, Ziklag and the other neighbouring place-names have different consonants. The prayer in Psalm 11 need not refer to a particular bird species."
